    for a computer vision class project (Harvard's CS2831). In it, I implemented
    and analyzed the performance of a general self-calibration algorithm
    proposed by a <a
      href="https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/3-540-57956-7_52"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer">paper</a
    > I had read for the class. The class as a whole (taught by Todd Zickler) was
    pretty interesting, and I'm glad that I had the chance to take it.
